# Implementation plan — Spec 1.8.0

## Summary

Spec 1.8.0 adds **`PageHeader`** and **`FeaturePage`** to `@webonone/ui-kit` for consistent feature-page structure inside `AppShell`, refactors WebOnOne v2 settings/home pages, adds a showcase demo, and creates **`feature-page-layout.mdc`**. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-feature-page-layout.md](./02-feature-page-layout.md), [03-cursor-rule.md](./03-cursor-rule.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.8.0` |
| Package build | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |
| Vite alias | WebOnOne already aliases `@webonone/ui-kit` to package `src/` in dev |

---

## Phase 1 — UI Kit layout components

**Goal:** Export `PageHeader` and `FeaturePage`.

**Exit criteria:** Package builds; types exported.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Create `PageHeader` | `ui-kit/package/src/layouts/PageHeader.tsx` |
| Create `FeaturePage` | `ui-kit/package/src/layouts/FeaturePage.tsx` |
| Export | `ui-kit/package/src/index.ts` |

**Verify:** `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit`

---

## Phase 2 — Showcase demo

**Goal:** Demonstrate default, narrow, and actions variants.

**Exit criteria:** Type-check passes.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Layout demo section | `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/ComponentsPage.tsx` (or `LayoutsPage.tsx` + nav) |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root`

---

## Phase 3 — WebOnOne v2 refactor

**Goal:** Migrate in-scope feature pages to `FeaturePage`.

**Exit criteria:** Type-check passes; pages match spacing contract.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Home | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/home/pages/HomePage.tsx` |
| Basic Settings | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/settings/basic/pages/BasicSettingsPage.tsx` — `maxWidth="2xl"` |
| Companies | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/settings/basic/pages/CompaniesPage.tsx` |
| System Theme | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/settings/system-theme/pages/SystemThemePage.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

---

